          "Control the derivative of the scalar inner product",
          "Regularize the angle and pass to the endpoint",
          "Choose a great-circle plane, including the degenerate cases",
          "Build an admissible arc of the required length",
          "Compare the lower integral with every admissible path"
        ]
      }
